%I A400460 #18 Oct 20 2026 23:58:13
%S A400460 24,180,1992,25974,371136,5619868,88585584,1438008120
%N A400460 Number of fixed polyforms with n cells in the honeycomb of the 15-faced Voronoi cell of the point (1/8, 1/6, 5/12) under space group Pn-3 (No. 201, origin choice 1).
%C A400460 The cell is a 15-faced space-filling polyhedron (3^6 4^3 5^2 6^2 7^2 faces) arising as the Voronoi cell of the orbit of the point (1/8, 1/6, 5/12) under space group Pn-3 (No. 201); its honeycomb has 24 cell types (translation classes), each cell with 15 face-neighbors. Polyforms are face-connected clusters of cells, counted up to lattice translation only.
%C A400460 The symmetry group G of the tiling has order 24 modulo lattice translations (12 proper), and the counts satisfy the Burnside identity |G|*free(n) = Sum_g Fix_g(n).
%H A400460 Mathias Bernhard, <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.07160">The Josehedron</a>, arXiv:2604.07160 [cs.CG], 2026 (method precedent; roundness benchmark).
%H A400460 Tyler Satchel Orden, <a href="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22502081">Certified space-filling polyhedra from a gated agentic search: code, certificates, catalog (MINT)</a>, Zenodo, 2026.
%H A400460 Tyler Satchel Orden, <a href="/A400460/a400460.txt">Honeycomb adjacency and symmetry tables, with the enumeration program and run instructions</a>.
%H A400460 Wikipedia, <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_space_groups">List of space groups</a>.
%o A400460 (C++) // Redelmeier-style table-driven enumerator; see the a-file (same program as A398957).
%Y A400460 Cf. A398957, A398958, A398959 (Josehedron polyforms, same enumerator); A385028, A397707-A397709 (polyforms on other space-filler honeycombs).
%Y A400460 Cf. A400461 (one-sided), A401255 (free).
